"""A Level Geology (0755), Lower Sixth: practice sets for Igneous Petrology, Metamorphic Petrology and the Examination module.

One 8-question set per lesson (11 topic lessons, 3 examination lessons), plus 'Paper 1 mock exam A' (50 multiple-choice questions,
two for each of the 25 Lower Sixth topics, so the five modules are covered in proportion to their topic counts) and 'Paper 2
practice paper A' (25 auto-markable parts in six numbered questions). Exam facts are only those of the Board's 2023 subject report
(Paper 1 = 50 multiple-choice questions; Paper 2 = essay paper of six questions; Paper 3 = practical paper of five compulsory
questions). The timings of the mock papers (90 and 150 minutes) are KKEVO practice settings, not Board settings. There is no Paper 3
mock: practical skills are practised in the Paper 3 lesson and its set. Numerical answers were checked by script.
"""

